rs 3  devs and it will be published by wb  under the port key games label which is  a label specifically created for the  wizarding world of harry potter a full  trailer of the game leaked back in 2018  when a reddit user posted it online he  claimed to have been part of a mall  survey group that was shown a trailer  for the game and somehow managed to get  by without signing an nda the game was  finally officially announced at the ps5  showcase event back in 2020 and was set  to release in 2021 before being delayed  it's now scheduled to release around the  2022 holiday season of november and  december avalanche has also done an  incredible job of creating the four  hogwarts common rooms and even in the  limited look we've seen so far their  uniqueness and attention to detail  within each of the common rooms is  evident the hogwarts kitchens are  buzzing with activity house elves  included and the devs even managed to  include the fifth floor prefix bathroom  again with a remarkable attention to  detail as for the main character our  backstory remains shrouded in mystery  we'll start hogwarts as a fifth year  with an unusual ability to manipulate  powerful ancient magic hidden in the  wizarding world the specific ancient  powers we can unlock appear to manifest  in different ways we see two in the  gameplay trailer as the narrator says  you can even use the mysterious powerful  magic your professors do not understand  to obliterate your strongest foes the  powers appear to show up visually with a  sort of blue black and white spell  effect with both a dash and lightning  ability shown here it's also known that  our main character survived something  significant that makes us a bit of a  celebrity when we start off at hogwarts  not unlike harry there's been quite a  bit of discussion about how exactly the  sorting ceremony will work but we do  know that we'll choose our house at the  start of the game again i can't  reiterate this one enough guys it is on  the official website we will choose our  house at the start of the game the devs  have hinted at players meeting up with a  weasley or two throughout the halls of  hogwarts we also know the identity of  one dark wizard here victor rookwood who  is almost certainly an ancestor of  augustus rookwood the rookwood of the  1890s is involved with a goblin by the  name of ranrock who appears to be  organizing a rebellion against wizard  kind there are three npc companions that  have been confirmed so far  onnai a gryffindor with a love for  adventure seeking justice poppy's  sweetie a hufflepuff with a strong  connection to magical beasts and  sebastian sallow a slytherin with a  troubling family secret likely related  to some sort of curse we'll also be  traveling to familiar locations  including the forbidden forest and  hogsmeade village diagon alley has yet  to be confirmed for the game and yes i  know we see all vanders in the trailer  however look closely that's the  hogsmeade branch of the wand shop in the  first official trailer we did see a shot  of dementors in what appears to be  azkaban however this is yet to be  confirmed as a location we'll actually  visit in-game magical creatures will  feature prominently and a number of them  have been confirmed including centaurs  goblins house elves grab horns moon cavs  acromantula floopers nasals trolls  hippogriffs dragons thestrals and even  dementors and inferior speaking of  thestrals our character can see and  interact with them which confirms we had  to have witnessed death at some point  some of the creatures have been  corrupted by an unknown magical force  many of the enemies in the gameplay  trailer have glowing red eyes which is  likely the indication of creatures  corrupted by this dark magic jk rowling  is not directly involved with the  project however hogwarts legacy does  plan to adhere to the wizarding world  lore set forth in the harry potter books  we'll be able to customize our character  and upgrade various talents and  abilities we can also purchase gear and  cosmetics at hogsmeed village and to be  clear that's in-game money as hogwarts  legacy has been confirmed to have no  micro transactions by both the official  website and chandler wood the hogwarts  legacy community manager vendors and  residents will populate the countryside  outside the walls of hogwarts with  unique stories to tell in missions where  they may need our main character's  assistance broomsticks and flying are  shown in the trailer but we still don't  have any confirmation about whether or  not we'll be able to play quidditch in  the game despite several hints in both  trailers specific spells shown in the  trailer include lumos accio reducto  defindo rapero apugno confringo incendio  and guardium leviosa expelliarmus  descendo petrificus totalis stupefy and  yes be careful where you choose to  explore as it may lead you down a darker  path  [Music]  wizard duels are also confirmed and the  game appears to feature quite a robust  spell casting system that allows you to  chain spells together you can brew  potions to aid or even use certain  magical creatures to help when battling  other wizards there's a chance merlin  can play a key role in the game as his  name is seen on the window in the  gameplay trailer here the same trailer  also mentions puzzles designed by merlin  the room of requirement is confirmed to  be in the game and appears to act as a  hub for our character we can brew  potions here and create a menagerie to  neutral magical beasts back to health as  some may be injured thanks to poachers  in the area we can even customize this  space to reflect our personality and  magical specialties the game also  appears to have a clever built-in fast  travel system through the use of various  flue powder stations which you can spot  throughout the gameplay trailer these  stations bear the name of ignatia  wildsmith the witch who invented flu  powder day night cycles are officially  confirmed as are seasonal weather  changes now if you guys are looking for  a much more in-depth breakdown of the  lore we know so far about hogwarts  legacy then check out the video on the  right side of your screen now as always  thank you all so much for watching i'll  talk to you again soon
 

